<title>GERMANY: Buba revises up Jan Pan-German industry orders.</title>
<headline>Buba revises up Jan Pan-German industry orders.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following revised index figures:</p>
<p>    PAN-GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS   Jan 97	   Dec 96</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +2.7	     -1.9</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.7	     +1.9</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    98.8 (98.5)    96.2</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 +3.0	     -2.1</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		   +4.3	     +2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		    97.5 (97.1)    94.7</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN INDUSTRY ORDERS</p>
<p> Month-on-month change(pct)	 -0.8	     +0.5</p>
<p> Year-on-year (pct)		  +11.5	     -1.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1991)		   131.5 (132.0)  132.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures are seasonally adjusted. The percentage change figures are calculated by Reuters from the indices.</p>
<p>Previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
